# CR 613.4d: layer 7d switches power and toughness after layers 7a-7c. Giant
# Tortoise (printed 1/1) is untapped, so its own layer 7c "+0/+3" makes it
# 1/4: three damage is not lethal. About Face then switches the total, 4/1,
# so the three damage is lethal (CR 704.5g). Switching the printed 1/1 before
# the +0/+3 would leave a 1/4 and the Tortoise would live. Forge keeps the
# switch as a hidden keyword whose odd count swaps Card.getNetPower and
# getNetToughness (Card.java:4448-4458).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets 3
castspell human 1
resolvestack
